;; tate 盾 — coded legal-procedure registry (ADR-2606112301 + worldwide ADR-2606112400).
;; :representative — the common procedures a private individual RECEIVES from courts /
;; government / companies, per jurisdiction, with DISCLOSED response options + deadline
;; RULES (never computed dates — the member verifies the service date, G4;
;; :verify-current-law true everywhere). tate maps notice → options; the MEMBER decides
;; and self-submits (G1/G3 UPL: no representation, no individualized legal judgment).
;;
;; :proc/jurisdiction      :jp | :us | :eu | :uk | :de (G10 — never crossed)
;; :proc/genuine-channels  how the REAL document arrives (vector). The 架空請求 / fake-
;;   lawsuit-notice discriminator (G6): court vocabulary on any OTHER channel (SMS /
;;   email / ordinary mail where formal service is required) is :suspected-fake.
;;   JP 特別送達 · US personal service / certified mail / sheriff · DE förmliche
;;   Zustellung (gelber Umschlag) · UK court post · EU 加盟国法の formal service.

